# Sao chep file nay thanh `.env` roi dien key vao. `.env` DA nam trong
# .gitignore - tuyet doi khong commit no.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Track A (loi offline) chay duoc ma KHONG can key nao. Cac key duoi day chi
# mo them tinh nang, khong phai dieu kien de he thong chay.

# --- Gemini -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Dung cho:
#   1. Tang 2 cua scripts/build_augment_features.py (--llm) - chay 1 lan moi
#      set, offline, ket qua cache vao data/augment_features.json.
#   2. Vai tro B luc runtime (features.enable_llm_refinement) - chi lam muot
#      cau chu, KHONG duoc doi thu hang (SPEC 3.5.3).
# Lay tai: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Riot -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dung cho scripts/crawl_augment_stats.py -> data/augment_stats.csv, thay bo
# so gia lap MOCK-NOT-REAL bang so do duoc tu tft-match-v1.
#
# LUU Y: Personal Key HET HAN SAU 24 GIO. Phai vao portal lay lai key moi
# moi lan crawl. Lay tai: https://developer.riotgames.com/
RIOT_API_KEY=
